 "$schema_note": "tau desktop tokens: the Ember palette (MIT, Hossam Saraya), three variants (ember, the default; ember-soft; ember-light), and tau's own values under 'tau'. kind.link and kind.link_active are the owner's own link colours. Type entries are [family, size px, line px, weight, use]. Every hue has a mark token and a text token, mapped in tau.hues; text always uses the text token. Syntax: rune-kit's scanners colour only, through syntax_kit_map; the style fields apply only if a tree-sitter highlighter is added later. Calm pass 2026-11-15: surface.raised, surface.sunken, border.hairline, tint.row_fail, tint.note_range, tint.note_active and rule.note_leader are new; Ember values come from the sketch (e12-tau-calm), except tint.note_active, darkened so coloured content text keeps 4.5:1 on it; Soft and Light are derived (reference/visual-language.md §4). Calm challenge 2026-11-15: surface.current is new (the sidebar's current row); Light surface.side, surface.cursor.read, tint.note_range and tint.note_active moved so that a fill that is a cue on its own reaches Ember's step (tau.fill_cue_min).",
